OL,3,COne-year-old boy in hospital after
OL,4,C'fall from window'
OL,6,FA one-year-old boy is in hospital with
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after
OL,8,Freportedly falling from a window in
OL,9,FKent.K
OL,11,FPolice said it received a call from
OL,12,FSouth East Coast Ambulance Service at
OL,13,Faround 6.10pm on Sunday that
OL,14,Fparamedics were treating the child
OL,15,F"who was reported to have fallen from
OL,16,Fa window of a property" in Cornwallis
OL,17,FAvenue in Gillingham.
OL,19,FIt is understood the fall was from a
OL,20,Fflat above a convenience shop.
