OL,3,COne-year-old boy in hospital after
OL,4,C'fall from window'
OL,6,FA force spokeswoman said: "Officers
OL,7,Fattended and the child was taken to a
OL,8,FLondon hospital with life-threatening
OL,9,Finjuries.
OL,11,F"Inquiries into the circumstances are
OL,12,Fongoing."
